btt diff
├── when a revision is compared with the working tree
│   ├── it reports added removed and conservatively renamed behaviors
│   ├── it reports whole file additions and deletions
│   └── it sees uncommitted tree changes
├── when two revisions are compared
│   ├── it emits the documented json shape
│   ├── it returns one with exit code when differences exist
│   └── it returns zero for identical revisions
├── when invoked below the repository root
│   └── it discovers trees across the repository
└── when the comparison cannot be made
    ├── it clearly reports an unknown revision
    └── it emits one json error object and exits two
